<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>You can instant place stairs, all you have to do is:

1) Download the macro
2) Change your fortnite wall keybind to c
3) Assign the macro to letter c
4) enjoy macro

if you have issues, contact me or another macro creator

Keyran on top &lt;3</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 6 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 0 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>